[Nabladown server][nd-server] is a tool for visualizing [`nabladown`][nd] files through a hot-reloading server[^1].

![Nabladown server quick start](/posts/NabladownServer/NabladownServer.webm)

## Motivation

I wanted to write my personal notes using the [`nabladown`][nd] markup language, but `nabladown.js` is a parsing and rendering library, not a file viewer. So I decided to create a tool to view these `.nd` files.

The main features are:
- List local [`.nd`][nd] files
- Render [nabladown files][nd] with hot reloading[^1]
- Dark/light themes
- Serve media files, such as images and videos
- Add optional custom CSS
- Simple editor `UI`

For more, go check on the GitHub page.

